{
  "id": "RAW_79c0f0ccec",
  "title": "GPT-6 Astra：时薪不到 6 美元的自动 AI 工程师",
  "url": "https://www.latent.space/p/astra",
  "date": "2026-09-04 05:09:41",
  "author": "Latent.Space",
  "siteName": "Latent.Space",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div dir=\"auto\" class=\"body markup\">\n   <p><strong>GPT-6 Astra</strong><span>, the first </span><a href=\"https://x.com/ZeffMax/status/2095582617035063375?s=20\">Stargate</a><span> and </span><a href=\"https://x.com/rasbt/status/2095141254958858496\">lightly looped</a><span> supermodel from OpenAI, </span><a href=\"http://GPT-6 Astra’s launch\">launched today</a><span>, cleanly beating </span><a href=\"https://www.latent.space/p/ainews-claude-fablemythos-51-new\">Fable 5.1</a><span> on many metrics including completely saturating the hardest versions of </span><a href=\"https://buttondown.com/ainews/archive/ainews-frontiermath-a-benchmark-for-evaluating/\">FrontierMath</a><span> (97.6%) and </span><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-astra/#citation-top-1\">ARC-AGI-3</a><span> (99.9%). Lots of demos will focus on typical talk tracks like the </span><a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2095595741528125780\">computer use</a><span> to the </span><a href=\"https://x.com/Clad3815/status/2095596013168050551\">Pokemon playing</a><span> to </span><a href=\"https://x.com/tomkrcha/status/2095598645190291775\">Blender</a><span> to the </span><a href=\"https://x.com/polynoamial/status/2095583211950833768\">scientific</a><span> and </span><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-astra/#citation-top-13\">cybersafety</a><span> benchmarks (</span><a href=\"https://deploymentsafety.openai.com/gpt-6-astra\">system card</a><span>). Greg says </span><a href=\"https://x.com/ZeffMax/status/2095582614648447179\">AGI is here</a><span>, and Jakub says it is </span><a href=\"https://www.latent.space/p/ainews-openai-to-reach-agi-bar-by\">finally the Automated AI Research Intern</a><span> he wanted. </span></p>\n   <p><span>We aren’t qualified to talk about those, but we got early access and threw it at every practical, real-life task we could think of. After burning </span><strong>over 20B tokens of Astra</strong><span>, we can confirm the most surprising finding: </span><strong>GPT-6 Astra</strong><span> </span><strong>is one of a new class of models</strong><span style=\"min-width:0;\" data-state=\"closed\"><a data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\" class=\"footnote-anchor\">1</a></span><strong> that are fully capable AI Engineers in their own right</strong><span>. They now help you </span><strong>choose and train models</strong><span>, </span><strong>label data</strong><span> (both helping you label and then using your labels for active learning, like </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sVo7SC62voA\">SAM</a><span>), </span><strong>keep pipelines saturated</strong><span>, </span><strong>instrument and read logs</strong><span>, </span><strong>deploy and debug entire systems</strong><span> in one shot, fan out and </span><strong>command and eval subagents</strong><span> (including agents running other models), and keep coherence over </span><strong>billions</strong><span> of tokens of a single agent thread.</span></p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:814,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:3531918,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.latent.space/i/214051010?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_f60dbb10-9849-49e5-8569-5dfba8440b9c_2486x1390.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p></p>\n   <h2 class=\"header-anchor-post\">Raising Your Ambitions\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n      <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Link\" data-href=\"https://www.latent.space/i/214051010/raising-your-ambitions\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft iconButton-mq_Et5 iconButtonBase-dJGHgN buttonBase-GK1x3M buttonStyle-r7yGCK size_sm-G3LciD priority_secondary-S63h9o\">\n       <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link\">\n        <path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path>\n       </svg>\n      </button>\n     </div>\n    </div></h2>\n   <p><span>We’ve written before about </span><a href=\"https://www.latent.space/p/ainews-the-high-return-activity-of?utm_source=publication-search\">the high-return activity of raising your aspirations for LLMs</a><span>. </span><strong>Our experience has made us exponentially more ambitious than we have ever been</strong><span>. Over the past month, we went from prompting humans for a fun “</span><a href=\"https://x.com/swyx/status/2085517544795079014\">Kill My SaaS</a><span>” competition</span><span style=\"min-width:0;\" data-state=\"closed\"><a data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\" class=\"footnote-anchor\">2</a></span><span>, to building a </span><a href=\"https://tools.aieconf.com/\">dozen internal/personal tools</a><span>, including </span><a href=\"https://swyx.io/tools\">4 previously paid SaaS tools</a><span>, fully </span><a href=\"https://swyx.io/\">redesigned my personal site</a><span>, made an incomplete but functional </span><a href=\"https://forge.smol.ai/\">replacement of GitHub + Vercel</a><span>, trained game AI for </span><a href=\"https://overgrid.swyx.io/#ai-rivals\">a strategy board game with 10,000x more legal moves than Go</a><span>, saved tens of thousands of dollars in personal finance cleanups, </span><a href=\"https://learninpublic.org/\">republished my old book</a><span> with synced audiobook audio and printed physical editions, and even </span><a href=\"https://aeo.latent.space/\">more</a><span> </span><a href=\"https://news.latent.space/\">ambitious</a><span> projects we will launch soon.</span></p>\n   <p><span>The $6 an hour number might sound surprising, but that’s exactly what we saw in </span><a href=\"https://aeo.latent.space/#operations\">our testing</a><span> - 33 tokens per second at a max $50 per million token rate. Given that Astra is more token efficient than Sol and Fable (</span><a href=\"https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2095595494081024077\">independently confirmed by Artificial Analysis</a><span>), it often means that Astra is simultaneously also the best fast-and-smart model you can buy (assuming our preview latency holds for GA), outside of </span><a href=\"https://www.latent.space/p/ainews-muse-spark-13-matches-gpt\">Spark 1.3</a><span>.</span></p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1323,&quot;width&quot;:1242,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:175252,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.latent.space/i/214051010?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_b0375b67-d3c7-42f6-9252-8385fbda5ae1_1242x1323.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n     <figcaption class=\"image-caption\">\n      <a href=\"https://aeo.latent.space/#operations\">our logs</a>\n     </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <h2 class=\"header-anchor-post\">Managing fleets of subagents (individually tweaked, bounded concurrency)\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n      <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Link\" data-href=\"https://www.latent.space/i/214051010/managing-fleets-of-subagents-individually-tweaked-bounded-concurrency\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft iconButton-mq_Et5 iconButtonBase-dJGHgN buttonBase-GK1x3M buttonStyle-r7yGCK size_sm-G3LciD priority_secondary-S63h9o\">\n       <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link\">\n        <path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path>\n       </svg>\n      </button>\n     </div>\n    </div></h2>\n   <p>Now of course, if you just throw on Astra at Ultra you’re gonna burn through a lot more than $6 per hour…. because it is so dang good at parallelizing.</p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:856,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:339552,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.latent.space/i/214051010?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_49d83c0e-13c1-4fad-b9cb-d88da10cf4f1_2428x1428.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p></p>\n   <h2 class=\"header-anchor-post\">Monitoring its own runs, starting and stopping waves\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n      <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Link\" data-href=\"https://www.latent.space/i/214051010/monitoring-its-own-runs-starting-and-stopping-waves\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft iconButton-mq_Et5 iconButtonBase-dJGHgN buttonBase-GK1x3M buttonStyle-r7yGCK size_sm-G3LciD priority_secondary-S63h9o\">\n       <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link\">\n        <path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path>\n       </svg>\n      </button>\n     </div>\n    </div></h2>\n   <p>This is basically what i’d pay a junior AI Engineer to do. and I spent about $100 over 2 days to do this.</p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:false,&quot;imageSize&quot;:&quot;large&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:760,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;bytes&quot;:380055,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.latent.space/i/214051010?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_a1ceb56b-6c89-4223-a1a0-5a7de77f2a0d_1605x838.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"sizing-large\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <h2 class=\"header-anchor-post\">Making model benchmarks, handling money, making estimates, scaling up runs, getting human ratings\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n      <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Link\" data-href=\"https://www.latent.space/i/214051010/making-model-benchmarks-handling-money-making-estimates-scaling-up-runs-getting-human-ratings\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft iconButton-mq_Et5 iconButtonBase-dJGHgN buttonBase-GK1x3M buttonStyle-r7yGCK size_sm-G3LciD priority_secondary-S63h9o\">\n       <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link\">\n        <path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path>\n       </svg>\n      </button>\n     </div>\n    </div></h2>\n   <p>Wild.</p>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:false,&quot;imageSize&quot;:&quot;large&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1177,&quot;width&quot;:1069,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;bytes&quot;:360955,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.latent.space/i/214051010?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_42d12f42-96ed-4321-8cf9-eca91edd3cb0_1069x1177.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"sizing-large\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n     <figcaption class=\"image-caption\"></figcaption>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:false,&quot;imageSize&quot;:&quot;large&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:618,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;bytes&quot;:484332,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.latent.space/i/214051010?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260903212316_569cef91-66ec-4d41-9f01-4fac519fd77b_2356x1000.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"sizing-large\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg>\n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n     <figcaption class=\"image-caption\">\n      <span>example </span><a href=\"https://swyxbench.sites.smol.ai/suites/aie-transcription/\">here</a>\n     </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p>We are out of time for this writeup, will complete this later, so if you are reading this on email, check back at the end of the day.</p>\n   <p><span>However the overall conclusion you should have is that OpenAI have clearly trained a model that is capable of automating much of their own AI Engineering, and it is finally time that you learn to exploit Astra- and Fable-class models and be far, </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fubhllmsBU&amp;pp=0gcJCUAdAYcqIYzv\">far more unreasonable</a><span>.</span></p>\n   <div id=\"youtube2-qqrk7CtkuIw\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;qqrk7CtkuIw&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:&quot;1s&quot;,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\" class=\"youtube-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"youtube-inner\">\n     <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/qqrk7CtkuIw?start=1s&amp;rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p></p>\n   <p></p>\n   <div data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\" class=\"footnote\">\n    <a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\" class=\"footnote-number\">1</a>\n    <div class=\"footnote-content\">\n     <p><span>We are </span><a href=\"https://aeo.latent.space/\">running similar work</a><span> on Grok, Fable and other similar frontier models but OpenAI was most generous with trial limits so this gets the writeup - but the agentic coding patterns discussed here will likely apply to all such late 2026 frontier models.</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\" class=\"footnote\">\n    <a id=\"footnote-2\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-2\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\" class=\"footnote-number\">2</a>\n    <div class=\"footnote-content\">\n     <p>Many of you are waiting to hear results… sorry for the radio silence! we got… busy! We will announce winners and reimbursements and best attempts.</p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "OpenAI 的 GPT-6 Astra 被演示为完全能干的 AI 工程师，能够自主选择并训练模型、管理子智能体集群、部署和调试系统——全部时薪约 6 美元，让用户能够以前所未有的规模执行更雄心勃勃的项目。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "OpenAI 的 GPT-6 Astra 被演示为完全能干的 AI 工程师，能够自主选择并训练模型、管理子智能体集群、部署和调试系统——全部时薪约 6 美元，让用户能够以前所未有的规模执行更雄心勃勃的项目。",
  "summary": "Latent.Space 分享了在使用超过 200 亿 token 后对 GPT-6 Astra 的早期上手体验——这是 OpenAI 的首颗「星门」和轻量循环超级模型。尽管官方演示聚焦于电脑操作、ARC-AGI-3 和 FrontierMath 基准测试，作者发现 Astra 最令人惊喜的能力是作为自给自足的 AI 工程师运作：它能自主选择并训练模型、为主动学习标注数据、维持流水线运转、植入监控并读取日志、一次性部署和调试整个系统、指挥和评估子智能体集群，并在单一线程中保持跨越数十亿 token 的一致性。实测数据显示 Astra 以 33 个 token/秒的速度运行，最高费率 50 美元/百万 token，平均时薪约 6 美元——与同类方案持平或更优。关键洞察在于，以 Ultra 模式全并行运行会迅速推高成本，因此必须管控并发度并限制子智能体集群规模。作者在合作后对自己的项目变得越来越大胆——重构工具、重新设计网站、训练游戏 AI 等。他们认为现在是时候充分利用 Astra 和 Fable 级模型，以更激进的态度重新定义 AI 的能力边界了。文章明确标注为进行中。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "GPT-6 Astra 作为完全自主的 AI 工程师，而非仅仅是编程助手",
      "explanation": "经过 200 亿 + token 的实际测试，作者发现 Astra 能够自主选择并训练模型、用主动学习标注数据、维持流水线饱和运转、植入监控并读取日志、一次性部署和调试整个系统、指挥和评估子智能体集群（包括运行其他模型的智能体），并在单一线程中跨越数十亿 token 保持连贯性——远超普通编程辅助工具的能力。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Astra 以约每小时 6 美元的价格提供前沿级能力",
      "explanation": "在 33 个 token/秒的速度和最高 50 美元/百万 token 的费率下，token 效率优于 Sol 和 Fable，Astra 成为实用工作的最佳快且智能选项。作者对照自身运营日志验证了这一数据，指出 Spark 1.3 是唯一可比的替代方案。"
    },
    {
      "point": "并行化是 Astra 的超能力，也是其成本风险",
      "explanation": "无限制地在 Ultra 模式下运行 Astra 会迅速烧钱，因为该模型极度擅长并行化工作。有效使用需要管理并发度、单独调优子智能体集群，并设置并行度上限——作者通过监控仪表盘展示了这一模式，呈现了智能体波次的自启动与自停止。"
    },
    {
      "point": "与 Astra 合作从根本上提升了用户的挑战野心",
      "explanation": "作者描述了野心的指数级增长：从一场有趣的 SaaS 竞赛，到搭建十几个内部工具、重新设计个人网站、打造 GitHub + Vercel 的替代品、为极复杂棋类游戏训练 AI，以及节省数万个人开支。他们认为部署 Astra 和 Fable 级模型的时代已经到来。"
    },
    {
      "point": "该文章尚未完稿，属于早期版本",
      "explanation": "作者明确表示时间不足，将在稍后完成本文，并提醒邮件订阅者稍后再来查看。注释 1 指出类似工作也在 Grok、Fable 和其他前沿模型上进行，暗示文中描述的 Agent 模式可能不仅适用于 Astra。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "烧掉超过 200 亿 token 的 Astra 之后，我们可以确认一个最令人惊喜的发现：GPT-6 Astra 属于一类全新的模型，它们本身就能成为完全能干的 AI 工程师。",
    "它们现在会帮你选择和训练模型、标注数据、维持流水线饱和运转、植入监控并读取日志、一次性部署和调试整个系统、发散并指挥和评估子智能体，并在单一线程的数十亿 token 中保持连贯。",
    "「每小时 6 美元」这个数字听起来可能令人惊讶，但那正是我们测试中看到的结果——33 个 token/秒，最高费率 50 美元/百万 token。",
    "当然，如果你直接丢给 Astra 的 Ultra 模式，你会烧掉远超 6 美元/小时的开销——因为它真的太擅长并行化了。",
    "是时候学会利用 Astra 和 Fable 级模型，并且大胆得不可思议了。"
  ],
